          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatulos",
            text: _("Hail, fellow dwarves! Well fought, and our thanks; we were sorely pressed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatulos",
            text: _("I had not expected to find allies so far from peopled lands. From whence do you hail?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Aiglondur",
            text: _("We come at the behest of Hamel, Lord of Knalga and Lord Companion of the Northern Alliance. We seek audience with your lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatulos",
            text: _("You are our honored guests, and I will show you to the best quarters we have myself. Then I must see to my troop’s care. Lord Karrag will have speech with you on the morrow."),
          },
